# Warm the car: harness starts it itself (harness:warm-car) 30 minutes
# before a morning leave-by in the diary, when the car reads below
# [butler] warm_below outside (it wakes the car once to read it). One tap
# makes the call below, exactly as it is; without the tap nothing is sent.
workflow warm-car
subject house
about Before a morning leave-by when it is below <warm below> °C at the car: asks with one tap to warm the car.
start harness:warm-car
tag no
limits steps 6, days 1

step ask
approve Warm the car for {event.leave}? It's {event.outside} °C at the car.
yes Warm it
no Not today
timeout 30m
on deny goto skip

step warm
tool car/car_climate {"state": "on"}
on fail goto failed

step warming
say {warm}
end

step failed
say The car didn't start warming: {warm.error}
end

step skip
end
